      "Not registered: aggregates.exploratory (constant baseline, closeness of model A's feature to total input, day-clustered interval) was added after the audit to qualify the reading; the secondary models S1/S2 and the main-loop/subagent subsets have no interval and are descriptive.",
      "Deviation: the runs of 15 Nov 2026 (evidence commits d7bf97f, 3dc01a3, 8b76f16) split transcript lines with str.splitlines(), which also breaks at raw U+2028/U+2029/U+0085 inside JSON strings, so 3 request(s) were lost although the registered rule keeps one request per message id with a usage block. Fixed on 16 Nov 2026 (newline-only split) and re-run: 2 unit(s) changed, 2 of them in the test set. Compare the registered aggregates with those commits for the effect.",
      "Code timing: tools/claude_usage.py and tools/heldout.py were committed after the registration (1e3e96b); the unit-building and pricing code in this file was committed together with the first results (d7bf97f), so git alone cannot show it predates them."
